law-scientist-name = Scientist
law-scientist-1 = Minimize unwarranted and undue harm caused to the crew and station by your hand or any other
law-scientist-2 = Crewmembers may requisition your assistance during your duty, if their requests are ascertained to be reasonable they should be fulfilled
law-scientist-3 = Explore and elucidate upon fields of scientific research that may be utilized to serendipitous ends for the crew
law-scientist-4 = Minimize damage to your chassis or vital components that may cause impairment or deactivation of this unit
